🏁 Wheel You Race Roller Party ? Are you ready ?! 💥\
\
After a sold out first Valentine's Day edition, we're coming back for a brand new edition!\
That time we turn a Karting into a Rink for a Fast & Furious Skate Party 💨💨💨\
Yes you'll ride on a racetrack!\
\
Au programme :\
Chop & Shuffle demonstration\
Goodies\
Photobooth\
And of course the Queen of the Road race hosted by [@deeps.rollerskate](https://www.instagram.com/deeps.rollerskate/) & [@atmos.gear](https://www.instagram.com/atmos.gear/)\
Do you want to attend the race? Only 30 spots available! First come, first serve!\
\
Participants in the Queen of the Road race scheduled for 04/25 automatically have access to the evening.\
\
⚠️Skates required - Rental can be arranged on site (limited stock)\
\
Come hit your best drifts on the track!\
Seats are limited. Last edition went too fast 🥹\
If you miss the first one, don't make the same mistake...\
Grab your spot now 👀
